    "writ_text": "PROVINCIAL OFFICE OF ARGONIA — WRIT OF PERSON\nIssued at the Writ House, Tidewrack, by the hand of Warden-Scribe Tuleeh-Ma.\n\nName recorded: Unwritten\nAlso called: \nObserved as: Khajiit\nRaised at: a river you have not heard of\nTrade declared: Reed-Walker\nTide drawn on: The Full Root (Raj-Xul)\nSecond tide: None recorded.\nRecorded: Left empty.\n\nCaste line: You walk the way people walk when they have been paid to walk somewhere.\nBounty ledger reference: TW-KHA-SCO\n\nThis case is stamped. It is the only thing in this province that says the bearer is a person rather than a shape somebody saw."
